    "text": "\u2022 Damage to roof tiles/ sheets etc. \u2022 Damage to power and communication lines. \u2022 Breaking of tree branches and uprooting of large avenue trees. \u2022 Damage to paddy crops, banana, papaya trees and orchards. \u2022 Damage to harbor yachts \u2022 Sea water inundation in low lying areas in the near coast. ACTION SUGGESTED: \u2022 Be cautious of potential hazards caused by damaged roof tiles or sheets. \u2022 Beware of fallen trees and power lines. \u2022 Be vigilant regarding impending extreme weather situation. \u2022 For emergency assistance contact the local disaster management authorities. \u2022 Requested to be attentive about future advisories issued by the Department of Meteorology",
